    "patchback.studio.ModuleSpec": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "One atomic module kind as the catalogue view draws it: its ports and the contracts of the parameters it owns (DESIGN.md sections 2 invariant 2, 5.1, 5.2). A kind of the fixed subtractive voice has no family; a kind added by section 5.4 names its family.",
